@baseUrl = http://localhost:4011

### first page, with a total count
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?limit=2&offset=0&includeTotal=true

### second page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?limit=2&offset=2&includeTotal=true

### an offset past the end returns an empty page, not an error
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?limit=2&offset=100&includeTotal=true

### limit must be between 1 and 100
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?limit=0

### limit above the maximum is rejected
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?limit=101

### a non-numeric offset is rejected
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?offset=abc
